hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1443","Muhammad bin Bashar told us, Hammad bin Masada told us, Ubayd Allah told us, Abu Musa told us, Abdul Wahhab, meaning Al-Thaqafi, told us, Ubayd Allah narrated to us, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Ibn Umar, that the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to “deliver a sermon after prayer,” and in the hadith of Hammad bin Masada: That means on Eid"
